{"id":"f63672a7ac0e50d2","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-truth-definition.md","title":"Truth Definition","display":"df-truth-definition — Truth Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-truth-definition","aliases":["90-df-truth-definition"],"display":"df-truth-definition — Truth Definition","depends_on":["[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-structure]]","[[90-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-truth-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-truth-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-definition — Truth Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"264cfff82242245c\" href=\"?note=264cfff82242245c\" title=\"90-df-structure\">90-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d4aaea13d19cf090\" href=\"?note=d4aaea13d19cf090\" title=\"90-df-satisfaction\">90-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq S^*\">\\(S\\subseteq S^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\subseteq S^*\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\subseteq S^*\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a> 的签名包含关系及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sharp\">\\(\\sharp\\)</span> 翻译；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{arith}},\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{arith}},\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle A,C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle A,C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"264cfff82242245c\" href=\"?note=264cfff82242245c\" title=\"90-df-structure\">90-df-structure</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_{(S^*)^\\sharp}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_{(S^*)^\\sharp}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>；假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright S_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright S_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>，约化在下式定义，满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d4aaea13d19cf090\" href=\"?note=d4aaea13d19cf090\" title=\"90-df-satisfaction\">90-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\">\\(d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\operatorname{Expr}(S)\\)</span>，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\operatorname{Expr}(S)}(g,d)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S^*}^{(1)}\">\\(\\tau(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S^*}^{(1)}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>，数码及其代入使用当前算术子语言。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_{S,\\mathcal M,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthDef}_{S,\\mathcal M,g}\\)</span> 在此固定环境内定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright S&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle A,C\\upharpoonright C_S,(F_n\\upharpoonright F_S^n)_{n\\ge1},\n(R_n\\upharpoonright R_S^n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright S_{\\mathrm{arith}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle A,C\\upharpoonright C_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}},\n(F_n\\upharpoonright F_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^n)_{n\\ge1},\n(R_n\\upharpoonright R_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_{S,\\mathcal M,g}(\\tau)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\\n\\left(\\mathcal M\\models\\tau(\\overline{g(\\sigma)})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright S\\models\\sigma\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright S&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle A,C\\upharpoonright C_S,(F_n\\upharpoonright F_S^n)_{n\\ge1},\n(R_n\\upharpoonright R_S^n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright S_{\\mathrm{arith}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle A,C\\upharpoonright C_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}},\n(F_n\\upharpoonright F_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^n)_{n\\ge1},\n(R_n\\upharpoonright R_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^n)_{n\\ge1}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{TruthDef}_{S,\\mathcal M,g}(\\tau)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\\n\\left(\\mathcal M\\models\\tau(\\overline{g(\\sigma)})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathcal M\\upharpoonright S\\models\\sigma\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthDef}_{S,\\mathcal M,g}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthDef}_{S,\\mathcal M,g}(\\tau)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 中定义其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-约化的真句编码；把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 纳入下标，避免同一环境结构含有多个对象语言约化时发生隐藏参数漂移。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> 的算术约化被显式固定为标准自然数结构，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{g(\\sigma)}\">\\(\\overline{g(\\sigma)}\\)</span> 的解释确为编码数本身</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的Gödel数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>句子集</li>\n<li>Tarski 定理限制同层语言中的定义；更强的元语言或带满足谓词的扩张可以定义对象语言真值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-syntax-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"264cfff82242245c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"d4aaea13d19cf090","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\